      },
      "worked": "Divide numerator and denominator by $\\cos20^\\circ$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\cos20^\\circ+\\sin20^\\circ}{\\cos20^\\circ-\\sin20^\\circ}&=\\frac{1+\\tan20^\\circ}{1-\\tan20^\\circ}\\\\\\frac{\\cos20^\\circ+\\sin20^\\circ}{\\cos20^\\circ-\\sin20^\\circ}&=\\frac{\\tan45^\\circ+\\tan20^\\circ}{1-\\tan45^\\circ\\tan20^\\circ}\\\\\\frac{\\cos20^\\circ+\\sin20^\\circ}{\\cos20^\\circ-\\sin20^\\circ}&=\\tan(45^\\circ+20^\\circ)\\\\\\frac{\\cos20^\\circ+\\sin20^\\circ}{\\cos20^\\circ-\\sin20^\\circ}&=\\tan65^\\circ.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
